Title: 0009-aros-intuition-menu
Repository: pragtical
Base-Commit: 5c05f09e081833b581fb5ecd10e64963dec87f03
Requires: 0008-lua54-language-test-env.patch
Author: aros-pragtical project
Date: 2026-11-15
Upstream-Status: local-only
Scope: AROS-only Intuition menu and event dispatch; renderer and command semantics unchanged

Problem:
  Pragtical renders its own menu but does not expose commands through the native Intuition menu.
Solution:
  Provide a native menu definition and forward its selections as SDL user events to core.on_event, which performs the same commands as the application menu.
Validation:
  x86_64 ABIv1 GCC 10.5 build; native File > New, Edit > Select All and Help > About passed on the 20261113 runtime.
Removal:
  Permanent AROS integration; remove only if equivalent native menu support is provided elsewhere.

